{
  "text": " Attention Atlanta lawyers, are you ready to be a part of the fastest growing field of litigation? According to Rolling Stone magazine, COVID related litigation is projected to experience tremendous growth in the next 10 years. This field is bigger than big tobacco and asbestos combined. Don't miss out on the opportunity to network with leading attorneys engaged in COVID litigation and attend panel workshops and keynotes at the COVID litigation conference on March 25th and 26th in Midtown Atlanta. Whether you're a season litigator or just starting out, this conference will leave you ready to engage in this rapidly growing field of litigation. Register now for the COVID litigation conference at covidlitigation.com. That's covidlitigation.com, brought to you by BSRF and the Mendenhall Law Group.",
